target/
.git
docs/
deploy/
# runbooks/ is NOT excluded: munarium-authoring embeds every experiment runbook
# and shape with include_str! at COMPILE time (src/munarium-authoring/src/catalog.rs
# `embeds!`), so excluding them from the build context breaks the image build
# outright — 26 "couldn't read ../../../runbooks/..." errors, which is exactly
# how this was found (2026-08-20, first image build since authoring landed).
conformance/fixtures/
**/*.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
.sqlx-cache/

# contract/ is NOT excluded, and must not be (S-1.0). It holds the vendored
# Munarium Matrix contract; nothing include_str!s a schema from it yet, but the
# runbooks/ note above is what an excluded-but-embedded directory costs, and the
# whole point of vendoring is that the bytes are available where the code is.
# Note **/*.md above DOES drop contract/matrix/README.md from the build context:
# embed a .json schema from here, never the prose.
